    <detaileddescription>
<para>Min-Heap implementation using a dynamic array (std::vector).</para>
<para>Array-based implementation of a complete binary tree. The parent node always has a smaller calorie value than its child nodes.</para>
<para>Maintains the heap property based on <ref refid="struct_recipe" kindref="compound">Recipe</ref> calorie values. </para>
